{"id":"n57332-1-7","stage":1,"title":"카메라 · 照相机","scene":"居住与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n57332-1-7-1","ko":"다음 주에 여행을 가는데 카메라 좀 빌려줄래?","zh":"下周我要去旅行，能借我相机用一下吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"다음","meaning":"以后，下次","explanation":"다음：以后，下次","readings":[{"term":"다음","audio":"/audio/aef613c6612d424ab454.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64531","senseId":"5","lemma":"다음","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"주에","meaning":"周，星期","explanation":"주：周，星期；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"주","audio":"/audio/6234d5b178a8b25809d8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"46811","senseId":"1","lemma":"주","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"여행을","meaning":"旅行，旅游","explanation":"여행：旅行，旅游；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"여행","audio":"/audio/b5d87b0a7b5d6b82f2a8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28026","senseId":"1","lemma":"여행","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가는데","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"14","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"카메라","meaning":"照相机","explanation":"카메라：照相机","readings":[{"term":"카메라","audio":"/audio/6e2b53040cd15b607281.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57332","senseId":"1","lemma":"카메라","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"빌려줄래?","meaning":"借；给予，给","explanation":"빌리다：借；주다：给予，给；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。；ㄹ래：非敬语地表达意愿或询问对方意愿。","readings":[{"term":"빌리다","audio":"/audio/7cc8358d972a7f6932ef.mp3"},{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17824","senseId":"1","lemma":"빌리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"82136","s