nary"}]},{"text":"갖다","meaning":"持，带，戴","explanation":"갖다：持，带，戴；다：连接途中转换或接续的动作，具体要结合前后文。","readings":[{"term":"갖다","audio":"/audio/48e4cf165dc4c1c6d001.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29738","senseId":"1","lemma":"갖다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"줄게.","meaning":"给予，给","explanation":"주다：给予，给；ㄹ게：向对方表达说话人的决定或承诺，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"82136","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"d39087dda3899d88","term":"그래","zh":"好吧，是","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3","entryId":"27656","definition":"用于回答，表示“会那样做，是那样的，知道了”等肯定的含义。","pronunciation":["그래"]},{"id":"1e07b94ba5182a41","term":"내일","zh":"明天，明日","audio":"/audio/1e07b94ba5182a41e7de.mp3","entryId":"30193","definition":"今天的下一天。","pronunciation":["내일"]},{"id":"48e4cf165dc4c1c6","term":"갖다","zh":"持，带，戴","audio":"/audio/48e4cf165dc4c1c6d001.mp3","entryId":"29738","definition":"手里握着或身上携带着某物。","pronunciation":["갇따"]},{"id":"1b43f195318e9604","term":"주다","zh":"给予，给","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3","entryId":"82136","definition":"把东西等递给别人，让别人拥有或使用。","pronunciation":["주다"]}],"audio":"/audio/d202db561ab690b6675e.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.08,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=57332","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":36,"sequenceScore":1.5935,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["下周我要去旅行，能借我相机用一下吗？","好啊，我明天就拿过去给你。","觉得这帽子适合你就买了，不知道你喜不喜欢。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["下周我要去旅行，能借我相机用一下吗？","好啊，我明天就拿过去给你。","觉得这帽子适合你就买了，不知道你喜不喜欢。"],"answer":1}]}
